                <p>A Jewish agency in Italy.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d344-f2" n="27" xml:id="d344-f2-content">
                <p>Harold H. Tittmann, Jr., assistant to the Personal Representative of the
                    President to Pope Pins XII.</p>
            </note>
